        "product_summary": "Split leather upper: This specific style uses split cow leather, with the pebbled surface shown in actual close-up photographs.\n\nDecorative vamp knot: A braided cord detail sits across the low-entry upper, above the stitched moccasin toe seam.\n\nSlip-on opening: The unfastened entry and low collar form a classic casual loafer profile.\n\nRubber outsole sections: The actual bottom detail shows separated textured pads following the forefoot and heel.\n\nTwo colour directions: Dark Brown and Black are listed in EU38-47 for wholesale assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
